# LF LINE ENDINGS, EVERYWHERE.
#
# The content is GENERATED and the generators write LF explicitly
# (tools/balance/export.py, tools/content/gen_loc.py: newline="\n").
# Git for Windows converts the working copy to CRLF by default, and then
# `python tools/balance/export.py` would show EVERY content file as changed
# on every run - without a single real change in any of them. What the
# generator writes and what the repository holds have to be the same file,
# or the question "is the content up to date" cannot be answered by looking.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: leave them alone.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.fbx binary
*.blend binary
*.asset -text
*.prefab -text
*.unity -text
